.cursor/
.codex/
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md
agent-transcripts/
agent-tools/
**/prompts/
**/_agent*/

# --- Datos locales del gestor (NO publicar) ---
data/**
!data/.gitkeep
!data/README.md

# --- Capturas de validación ---
_s*_captures/
**/_captures/

# --- Informes y handoffs internos (NO publicar) ---
INFORME_S*.md
INFORME_UI_*.md
HANDOFF_*.md

# --- Legacy scripts locales ---
legacy/**

# --- Cachés / temporales / sandboxes ---
*.log
.tmp/
.temp/
